## 🗂️ Project Structure

```
universalrag/
├── app.py                    # Streamlit interface
├── server.py                 # FastAPI backend
├── requirements.txt
├── .env.example
├── src/
│   ├── config.py             # Settings and environment
│   ├── llm_client.py         # Gemini wrapper with offline fallback
│   ├── pipeline.py           # End-to-end orchestrator
│   └── modules/
│       ├── m1_upload.py
│       ├── m2_extraction.py
│       ├── m3_indexing.py
│       ├── m4_router.py
│       ├── m6_generation.py
│       ├── m7_tracking.py
│       ├── m9_state.py
│       ├── text_indexer.py
│       └── m5_agents/        # text, table, chart, image, data
├── frontend/                 # Next.js 14 + Tailwind chat UI
├── sample_data/              # Demo PDF, XLSX, CSV, and images
└── tests/                    # Pytest suite
```

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

**Backend:** Python · Google Gemini (`google-genai`) · FastAPI · Pandas · scikit-learn · Pillow · Matplotlib · Seaborn

**Frontend:** Next.js 14 · React 18 · TypeScript · Tailwind CSS · react-markdown · Streamlit

